      "raw_excerpt_utf8": "Our certificate of incorporation authorizes (i) 2,250,000,000 shares of common stock, with a par value of $0.0001 per share (of which 2,000,000,000 shares are designated as Class A common stock and 250,000,000 shares are designated as Class B common stock)",
